 "summary": "A general-purpose PNP bipolar transistor in the three-lead SOT-23 surface-mount package, paired with the NPN SS8050. It is rated -40 V collector to base, -25 V collector to emitter and -1.5 A of collector current, and dissipates 300 mW at 25 °C ambient. DC gain at -100 mA lies between 120 and 400 and is graded into three ranks, L, H and J.",
